    {
      "id": "78d51a0d-c05b-41e7-abc2-3b86b19cb324",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1420,
        "height": 400,
        "content": "## Invoice PDF from a purchase, using a saved template\n\n**What it does:** Turns an incoming order into a branded PDF invoice. It computes line totals, VAT and the grand total, renders a PDF from a template you manage in PolyDoc, emails it to the customer, and returns it on the webhook response.\n\n**Who it's for:** Anyone billing customers from a store, checkout, CRM or app that can POST an order.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your **PolyDoc API** credential on the *Render invoice PDF* node (free key at dashboard.polydoc.tech).\n2. Replace **YOUR_TEMPLATE_ID** with an invoice template you saved in PolyDoc.\n3. Add an **SMTP** credential on *Email invoice*, or swap it for Gmail / Slack / S3.\n\nStart free: https://polydoc.tech"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
